From: 483bc99fb9674ea92607847c5ecc18bfeda2d54d
Subject: [PATCH] bpf: offload: ignore namespace moves

上游 backport, 来自 mt6873-dev/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6885@cgroup-v2
